flowchart TD
  A["Venus QuickJS：频道可见或点击已读"] --> B["读取 `message.left-dialog-list`、`message.unread-summary`、`message.timeline` 完整 VM"]
  B --> C["Frame 内 `ActionBinding(channel_read)` / `HostObservation`"]
  C --> D["native 注入 actor/requestId/observedRevision/surfaceEpoch"]
  D --> E["ActionInvocationEnvelope / HostObservation / Inbound"]
  E --> F["MobileImSdk -> CoreBridge -> helix-driver-ffi"]
  F --> G["`Tick::Command/Inbound/PortReply/Timer`"]
  G --> H["`http_write`、`storage_upsert`、`projection`"]
  H --> I["Go authority：`POST /api/cses/post/read` body `{channelId,endTime?,startTime?,posts?}`；会话级已读 `POST /api/cses/channels/view` body `{channels:[{id,isRoot}]}`"]
  I --> J["WS/PortReply：`post_read`, `update_channel`; 离线 sync 可见 `channel_event(type=6)`"]
  J --> K["`PersistAtomic -> PersistOk`；SQLite `channel`、`message_receipt`"]
  K --> L{"PersistOk?"}
  L -- "否" --> X["保留旧 VM；ActionReceipt failed；可重试"]
  L -- "是" --> M["SurfaceComposer：`message.left-dialog-list`、`message.unread-summary`、`message.timeline`"]
  M --> N["InteractionFrameV2 schemaVersion=2"]
  N --> O["FFI batch -> C++ SurfaceRuntime 整帧校验"]
  O --> P{"epoch/revision/causation 合法?"}
  P -- "否" --> Y["保留最后一致 VM；请求 snapshot/resync"]
  P -- "是" --> Q["原子提交 DialogListVm + UnreadSummaryVm + TimelineWindowVm"]
  Q --> R["QuickJS im.surface.view/pending"]
  R --> S["移动 UI：会话未读数、频道已读边界和时间线读态同帧变化，重复可见观察幂等"]
  S --> T["FrameApplied / directive ack / action terminal"]
